{"id":"2b8b57640647c9bb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-boolalg.md","title":"Boolean algebra identities","display":"thm-boolalg — Boolean algebra identities","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-boolalg","aliases":["27-thm-boolalg"],"display":"thm-boolalg — Boolean algebra identities","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.2 Theorem 1.1 and proof","source_printed_pages":"9–10","source_pdf_pages":"33–34","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-boolalg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-boolalg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-boolalg — Boolean algebra identities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Theorem 1.1 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"9–10"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"33–34"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>；标量运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\qquad(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\qquad a\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\\\\na\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c),\\qquad a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge1=a,\\quad a\\vee0=a,\\quad a\\wedge0=0,\\quad a\\vee1=1,\\\\\na\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\quad a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\\\\na\\wedge\\neg a=0,\\quad a\\vee\\neg a=1,\\quad\\neg\\neg a=a,\\\\\n\\neg(a\\wedge b)=\\neg a\\vee\\neg b,\\qquad\\neg(a\\vee b)=\\neg a\\wedge\\neg b.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\qquad(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\qquad a\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\\\\na\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c),\\qquad a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge1=a,\\quad a\\vee0=a,\\quad a\\wedge0=0,\\quad a\\vee1=1,\\\\\na\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\quad a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\\\\na\\wedge\\neg a=0,\\quad a\\vee\\neg a=1,\\quad\\neg\\neg a=a,\\\\\n\\neg(a\\wedge b)=\\neg a\\vee\\neg b,\\qquad\\neg(a\\vee b)=\\neg a\\wedge\\neg b.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项代入 a,b,c 的八种取值即可证明。本次修复旧长公式把对象层 ∧ 与元层合取混排造成的解析歧义，并补入幂等、吸收、对合与 De Morgan 恒等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b,c\\in\\mathbb B$；标量运算见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\qquad(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\qquad a\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\\\\na\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c),\\qquad a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c),\\\\\na\\wedge1=a,\\quad a\\vee0=a,\\quad a\\wedge0=0,\\quad a\\vee1=1,\\\\\na\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\quad a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\\\\na\\wedge\\neg a=0,\\quad a\\vee\\neg a=1,\\quad\\neg\\neg a=a,\\\\\n\\neg(a\\wedge b)=\\neg a\\vee\\neg b,\\qquad\\neg(a\\vee b)=\\neg a\\wedge\\neg b.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1496,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-boolalg|thm-boolalg — Boolean algebra identities]]"}],"outgoing":["11de8465f2282555"]}